 "sentences": [
  "Poland’s forests are turning red and gold.",
  "This seasonal change happens as beech trees stop producing chlorophyll.",
  "NASA’s Landsat 9 satellite captured this transformation on October 8, 2026.",
  "Below the mountain meadows, European beech forests dominate the landscape.",
  "Brown bears are currently prowling these hills to fatten up for winter hibernation.",
  "European bison also roam here after being reintroduced in the 1960s."
